Skku Design System (packages/sds)

The code in this directory is ported from @toss/tds-react-native,
version 2.0.2, and was changed by the skkuverse-app project. The changes
are:

  - Tokens and APIs were renamed after SEED Design (daangn/seed-design).
  - Animation moved from @react-spring/native to react-native-reanimated.
  - The color palette was re-derived onto SEED's steps.
  - Colors moved to semantic roles (packages/shared/src/tokens/).

SDS.md describes these changes in more detail.

